{
    "chapter_num": 11,
    "verses_count": 47,
    "paragraphs_list": [
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "David Made King over All Israel"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 1,
                    "num_str": "1",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Then all Israel came together to David at Hebron, saying, “Indeed we "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "are"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " your bone and your flesh. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 2,
                    "num_str": "2",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Also, in time past, even when Saul was king, you "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "were"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " the one who led Israel out and brought them in; and the "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "DIVINE_NAME",
                            "text": "Lord"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " your God said to you, ‘You shall shepherd My people Israel, and be ruler over My people Israel.’ ” "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 3,
                    "num_str": "3",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Therefore all the elders of Israel came to the king at Hebron, and David made a covenant with them at Hebron before the "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "DIVINE_NAME",
                            "text": "Lord"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": ". And they anointed David king over Israel, according to the word of the "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "DIVINE_NAME",
                            "text": "Lord"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Lit. by the hand of Samuel"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "by Samuel."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "The City of David"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 4,
                    "num_str": "4",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And David and all Israel went to Jerusalem, which is Jebus, where the Jebusites "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "were,"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " the inhabitants of the land. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 5,
                    "num_str": "5",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "But the inhabitants of Jebus said to David, “You shall not come in here!” Nevertheless David took the stronghold of Zion (that is, the City of David). "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 6,
                    "num_str": "6",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Now David said, “Whoever attacks the Jebusites first shall be "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Lit. head"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "chief and captain.” And Joab the son of Zeruiah went up first, and became chief. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 7,
                    "num_str": "7",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Then David dwelt in the stronghold; therefore they called it "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Zion, 2 Sam. 5:7"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "the City of David. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 8,
                    "num_str": "8",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And he built the city around it, from "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Lit. The Landfill"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "the Millo to the surrounding area. Joab "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Lit. revived"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "repaired the rest of the city. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 9,
                    "num_str": "9",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "So David went on and became great, and the "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "DIVINE_NAME",
                            "text": "Lord"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " of hosts "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "was"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " with him."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "The Mighty Men of David"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 10,
                    "num_str": "10",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Now these "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "were"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " the heads of the mighty men whom David had, who strengthened themselves with him in his kingdom, with all Israel, to make him king, according to the word of the "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "DIVINE_NAME",
                            "text": "Lord"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " concerning Israel."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 11,
                    "num_str": "11",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And this "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "is"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " the number of the mighty men whom David had: Jashobeam the son of a Hachmonite, chief of "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "So with Qr.; Kt., LXX, Vg. the thirty (cf. 2 Sam. 23:8)"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "the captains; he had lifted up his spear against three hundred, killed "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "by him"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " at one time."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 12,
                    "num_str": "12",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "After him "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "was"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " Eleazar the son of Dodo, the Ahohite, who "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "was one"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " of the three mighty men. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 13,
                    "num_str": "13",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "He was with David at "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Ephes Dammim, 1 Sam. 17:1"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Pasdammim. Now there the Philistines were gathered for battle, and there was a piece of ground full of barley. So the people fled from the Philistines. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 14,
                    "num_str": "14",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "But they "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Lit. took their stand"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "stationed themselves in the middle of "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "that"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " field, defended it, and killed the Philistines. So the "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "DIVINE_NAME",
                            "text": "Lord"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " brought about a great victory."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 15,
                    "num_str": "15",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Now three of the thirty chief men went down to the rock to David, into the cave of Adullam; and the army of the Philistines encamped in the Valley of "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Lit. Giants"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Rephaim. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 16,
                    "num_str": "16",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "David "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "was"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " then in the stronghold, and the garrison of the Philistines "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "was"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " then in Bethlehem. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 17,
                    "num_str": "17",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And David said with longing, “Oh, that someone would give me a drink of water from the well of Bethlehem, which is by the gate!” "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 18,
                    "num_str": "18",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "So the three broke through the camp of the Philistines, drew water from the well of Bethlehem that "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "was"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " by the gate, and took "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "it"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " and brought "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "it"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " to David. Nevertheless David would not drink it, but poured it out to the "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "DIVINE_NAME",
                            "text": "Lord"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": ". "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 19,
                    "num_str": "19",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And he said, “Far be it from me, O my God, that I should do this! Shall I drink the blood of these men "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "who have put"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " their lives "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "in jeopardy?"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " For at the risk of their lives they brought it.” Therefore he would not drink it. These things were done by the three mighty men."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 20,
                    "num_str": "20",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Abishai the brother of Joab was chief of "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "another"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "So with MT, LXX, Vg.; Syr. thirty"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "three. He had lifted up his spear against three hundred "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "men,"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " killed "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "them,"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " and won a name among "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "these"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " three. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 21,
                    "num_str": "21",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Of the three he was more honored than the other two men. Therefore he became their captain. However he did not attain to the "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "first"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " three."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 22,
                    "num_str": "22",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Benaiah was the son of Jehoiada, the son of a valiant man from Kabzeel, who "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "was great in deeds"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "had done many deeds. He had killed two lion-like heroes of Moab. He also had gone down and killed a lion in the midst of a pit on a snowy day. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 23,
                    "num_str": "23",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And he killed an Egyptian, a man of "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "great"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " height, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "About 7 1⁄2 feet"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "five cubits tall. In the Egyptian’s hand "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "there was"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " a spear like a weaver’s beam; and he went down to him with a staff, wrested the spear out of the Egyptian’s hand, and killed him with his own spear. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 24,
                    "num_str": "24",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "These "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "things"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " Benaiah the son of Jehoiada did, and won a name among three mighty men. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 25,
                    "num_str": "25",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Indeed he was more honored than the thirty, but he did not attain to the "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "first"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " three. And David appointed him over his guard."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 26,
                    "num_str": "26",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Also the mighty warriors "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "were"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " Asahel the brother of Joab, Elhanan the son of Dodo of Bethlehem, "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 27,
                    "num_str": "27",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Shammah the Harodite, 2 Sam. 23:25"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Shammoth the Harorite, Helez the "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Paltite, 2 Sam. 23:26"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Pelonite, "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 28,
                    "num_str": "28",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Ira the son of Ikkesh the Tekoite, Abiezer the Anathothite, "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 29,
                    "num_str": "29",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Mebunnai, 2 Sam. 23:27"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Sibbechai the Hushathite, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Zalmon, 2 Sam. 23:28"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Ilai the Ahohite, "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 30,
                    "num_str": "30",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Maharai the Netophathite, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Heleb, 2 Sam. 23:29, or Heldai, 1 Chr. 27:15"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Heled the son of Baanah the Netophathite, "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 31,
                    "num_str": "31",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Ittai, 2 Sam. 23:29"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Ithai the son of Ribai of Gibeah, of the sons of Benjamin, Benaiah the Pirathonite, "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 32,
                    "num_str": "32",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Hiddai, 2 Sam. 23:30"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Hurai of the brooks of Gaash, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Abi-Albon, 2 Sam. 23:31"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Abiel the Arbathite, "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 33,
                    "num_str": "33",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Azmaveth the "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Barhumite, 2 Sam. 23:31"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Baharumite, Eliahba the Shaalbonite, "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 34,
                    "num_str": "34",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "the sons of "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Jashen, 2 Sam. 23:32"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Hashem the Gizonite, Jonathan the son of Shageh the Hararite, "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 35,
                    "num_str": "35",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Ahiam the son of "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Sharar, 2 Sam. 23:33"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Sacar the Hararite, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Eliphelet, 2 Sam. 23:34"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Eliphal the son of "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Ahasbai, 2 Sam. 23:34"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Ur, "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 36,
                    "num_str": "36",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Hepher the Mecherathite, Ahijah the Pelonite, "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 37,
                    "num_str": "37",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Hezrai, 2 Sam. 23:38"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Hezro the Carmelite, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Paarai the Arbite, 2 Sam. 23:35"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Naarai the son of Ezbai, "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 38,
                    "num_str": "38",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Joel the brother of Nathan, Mibhar the son of Hagri, "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 39,
                    "num_str": "39",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Zelek the Ammonite, Naharai the "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Beerothite, 2 Sam. 23:37"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Berothite (the armorbearer of Joab the son of Zeruiah), "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 40,
                    "num_str": "40",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Ira the Ithrite, Gareb the Ithrite, "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 41,
                    "num_str": "41",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Uriah the Hittite, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "The last sixteen are not added in 2 Sam. 23."
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Zabad the son of Ahlai, "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
